OL,3,GNEWSAMore anger and uncertainty ` so
OL,4,Awhat now for local councils?
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt has been another week when
OL,7,Fpoliticians and council officers across
OL,8,Fthe East have shaken their heads in
OL,9,Fdisbelief and probably uttered a few
OL,10,Fchoice expletives as well.
OL,12,FThe reason? Yet another delay to the
OL,13,Fplans to reform local government.
OL,15,FThis time it involves local government
OL,16,Freorganisation (LGR), which would see
OL,17,Fexisting county, borough, district and
OL,18,Fcity councils replaced by large unitary
OL,19,Fauthorities.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
